base</label><input class="form-control" name="database" autocomplete="off"></div><div class="col-12 mb-2"><label class="form-label">Table (schema.table optional)</label><input class="form-control" name="table" autocomplete="off" placeholder="orders"></div><div class="col-6 mb-2"><label class="form-label">Username</label><input class="form-control" name="username" autocomplete="off"></div><div class="col-6 mb-2"><label class="form-label">Password</label><input class="form-control" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password"></div></div></div><div data-connector-field="api" hidden><div class="mb-2"><label class="form-label">API URL</label><input class="form-control" name="url" placeholder="https://api.example.com/v1/records"></div><div class="mb-2"><label class="form-label">Bearer token <span class="text-subtle">· opsional</span></label><input class="form-control" type="password" name="token" autocomplete="new-password"></div><div class="mb-2"><label class="form-label">JSON path ke array <span class="text-subtle">· opsional</span></label><input class="form-control" name="json_path" placeholder="data.items"></div><p class="small-muted">API harus HTTPS dan mengembalikan JSON berisi objek baris. Redirect ditolak; maksimal 2 MB dan 5.000 baris.</p></div><div class="callout warning mt-3">Host publik saja secara default. IP/private/internal address ditolak; bila aman, admin server harus memasang host allowlist atau mode private-network khusus. Gunakan kredensial dengan hak baca minimum dan database replica bila tersedia.</div><button class="btn btn-primary w-100 mt-3">Test &amp; connect</button></form><?php endif;?></div></section><section class="panel mt-3"><div class="panel-body"><h2 class="panel-title">Batas konektor</h2><ul class="small-muted mt-2 mb-0"><li>Read-only SQL session; query identifier divalidasi.</li><li>Max 5.000 rows per source refresh.</li><li>TLS validation required for API; no redirects.</li><li>MySQL/PostgreSQL network policy needs operator review.</li><li>Secret is AES-256-GCM encrypted using APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY.</li></ul></div></section></div><div class="col-lg-7"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2 class="panel-title">Connected sources</h2><div class="panel-subtitle">Snapshot data diimpor ke dataset workspace dan discope per anggota.</div></div></div><?php if($sources):?><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Source</th><th>Type/status</th><th>Rows</th><th>Last updated</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($sources as $source):?><tr><td><strong><?=e($source['name'])?></strong><br><small class="text-subtle">Owner <?=e($source['owner_name'])?></small></td><td><span class="badge-soft"><?=e(strtoupper($source['source_type']))?></span><br><span class="source-status <?=e($source['status'])?>"><?=e($source['status'])?></span></td><td class="mono"><?=e(format_number((int)$source['row_count']))?></td><td><?=e($source['last_updated_at']?date('d M H:i',strtotime($source['last_updated_at'])):'—')?></td><td><div class="d-flex gap-1"><?php if($source['dataset_id']):?><a class="btn btn-light-outline btn-sm" href="<?=e(url('datasets/explorer.php?id='.$source['dataset_id']))?>">Explore</a><?php endif;?><?php if(can('connect',$workspace)):?><form method="post" action="<?=e(url('datasets/sync.php'))?>"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="source_id" value="<?=e($source['id'])?>"><button class="btn btn-light-outline btn-sm">Sync</button></form><form method="post" action="<?=e(url('datasets/source-delete.php'))?>" data-confirm="Hapus koneksi ini, snapshot dataset terkait, dan credential terenkripsi?"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="source_id" value="<?=e($source['id'])?>"><button class="btn btn-light-outline btn-sm">Hapus</button></form><?php endif;?></div></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><?php else:?><div class="empty-state m-3"><div class="empty-icon">⌘</div><strong>Belum ada koneksi tersimpan</strong><p>Gunakan upload file untuk memulai di Free atau ajukan Business untuk konektor remote.</p></div><?php endif;?></section></div></div>
